    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateStaleRejectionAndPlanDelta@1 as the Accelerate-owned hermetic stale rejection and PlanDelta against the PCPR-061 DatasetsContextPack@1 identity, the PCPR-062 Kit current root, the PCPR-063 route CID baguqeerab6vsy7orm6wmxmqbzqh5f57dasnufhgngvh47gw7g3whrkr5smga, the PCPR-064 patch CID baguqeeraphkktpgmcw2uusnbxlh7wfjblmhzb4oy3u55bbpdsvbt4xwvvb4q, the PCPR-065 run CID baguqeerazgo2lirhy7hrpa42j227gdpzmi3jl4jdajoz6jzqqx7td6fy7dpa, the PCPR-066 change CID baguqeeraowfymvuvscitvjkxn3sak6f4a2ctkfvflney26jen7gwyqplln6a, the PCPR-067 reuse CID baguqeera75dkjwczh6mehnwyqot25rbd2mazkgjuvb4lrvkdkuqo7vntieuq, and the PCPR-068 interface CID baguqeera3k54j374af37kxdvkfgkjdfdofbdtg3x5vckpsceemy4lyklw3dq. Stale ContextPack and protocol-test identities are rejected. Unaffected solver-qualification completion is preserved. The plan epoch increments from 1 to 2. The hermetic PlanDelta uses closed operations attach_evidence and add_task, does not mutate started or completed history, and refills two impacted-test tasks inside the 12-task and 20-epoch bounds. LogicProviderProtocol@2 is not reminted. DatasetsStaleRejectionAndPlanDeltaBinding@1 and KitStaleRejectionAndPlanDeltaBinding@1 consume delta CID baguqeerahbxnuho3jdzkwaar6yx4ers7ns3p73mm3ghhgc5mhmn5r2fg3pga without reminting pack, current-root, route, patch, run, change, reuse, or interface identities. Live supervisor application, live PlanDelta admission, and START stay typed unavailable. Missing a live Quack-fenced session emits operator-blocking task pcpr-069-operator-live-stale-rejection-and-plan-delta. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
